&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/debug-application-cluster/debug-application/#debugging-pods"&gt;Kubernetes Docs - Troubleshoot Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>